        "author": "thea",
        "became": "elder",
        "content": "You know that the fighting has spilled over and raiders are watching the east road. Warn the adults nearby, specifically Bryn and Inga, that the danger is now inside the walls and the roads are unsafe for travelers. [!warn(target=nearby, topic=raiders on the east road and danger inside the inn)]"
