      {
        "id": "learned-mabel-2",
        "n": 1456,
        "candidate": 1566,
        "author": "mabel",
        "became": "elder",
        "content": "It is night and raining. Mabel is at the Wick & Kettle inn with Brit, Bryn, Ivar, and Liv. Listen to what Bryn and Ivar say about the raiders and the storm. [!talk(target=bryn, topic=the raiders and the storm)] [!talk(target=ivar, topic=the village crowding the well)]"
      },
      {
