        "n": 1170,
        "candidate": 1408,
        "author": "hilde28",
        "became": "adult",
        "content": "It is night and the village has gathered at the well, leaving the fences unguarded while raiders circle. Do not linger in the dark. Go to the well to join the gathering and listen to the elders, but keep your eyes on the perimeter. [!go(to=well)] [!talk(target=nearby, topic=the raiders circling the fences)]"
      },
      {
        "id": "learned-rosa-well-panic",
        "n": 1145,
        "candidate": 1426,
        "author": "rosa",
        "became": "elder",
        "content": "It is night and the village has flocked to the well in a state of panic. Do not let the rumor of a quiet night fool you; the danger is now inside our own walls. Go to the well and warn the elders that the raiders are already circling within a stone's throw. [!go(to=well)] [!warn(target=nearby, topic=raiders circling and fences left open)]"
      },
      {
