        "became": "apprentice",
        "content": "It is night and raining, so you are resting at the Wick & Kettle inn. Since you are already here and have heard word of sickness from the east road, use this time to share that news with those nearby so they can prepare. [!talk(target=nearby, topic=word of sickness from the east road)]"
      },
      {
