        "content": "Raiders are no longer on the road but are at the eastern fence. The danger is at our doorstep. Go to the watchpost and prepare for defense, or warn the villagers to stay away from the east. [!go(to=watchpost)] [!warn(target=nearby, topic=the raiders are at the eastern fence)]"
